0:{"buildId":"7bDX3U26LLul0JhiFybGF","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"min-h-screen bg-bg pt-24","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"Add Proof Before CTA to Increase Landing Page Conversions\",\"description\":\"What visitors see before a CTA can change how they evaluate the ask. These proof-placement sequences are testable hypotheses, not universal laws.\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/#founder\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-07-15\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-07-27\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/#organization\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/learning-centre/proof-before-cta\"},\"image\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/opengraph-image\"}"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-14","children":[["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"Breadcrumb","className":"mb-8 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-fg-muted","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/","className":"hover:text-accent transition-colors","children":"Home"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":"/"}],["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/learning-centre","className":"hover:text-accent transition-colors","children":"Learning Centre"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":"/"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-fg","aria-current":"page","children":"Proof Before CTA"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8 md:p-10","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-accent","children":"Trust Leaks · Proof Before CTA"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-fg md:text-5xl","children":"Add Proof Before CTA to Increase Landing Page Conversions"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Sequencing is a testable conversion lever. When a page asks for commitment before it has established credibility, some visitors may hesitate. Test whether moving relevant, verifiable proof before the ask improves the behavior that matters."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/audit?utm_source=learning-centre-proof-before-cta&utm_medium=hero-cta","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-bg transition-opacity hover:opacity-85","children":"Get your free audit →"}],["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/repair-sprint","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded border border-border px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:border-fg-muted hover:text-fg","children":"Explore $97 Repair Sprint"}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"Why Asking Before Proving Fails"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"A practical hypothesis is that visitors evaluate an ask using the information they have already seen. A CTA that appears before any relevant evidence gives them less context for that judgment. The visitor bounces not because the offer is wrong - but because the page gave them no reason to trust it before demanding a decision."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"This is especially acute on paid traffic. Cold audiences arrive skeptical. They have seen dozens of pages that open with a button. Proof placed above the first CTA short-circuits that skepticism before it calculates an exit. The mechanism is simple: evidence creates micro-commitments (nods, agreement, recognition) that lower the psychological cost of clicking."}],"$L3"]}],"$L4","$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9","$La"]}]]}],null,"$Lb"]}],"isPartial":"$@c","staleTime":"$d","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$Le","isPartial":"$@f","staleTime":"$d","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L10","isPartial":"$@11","staleTime":"$d","varyParams":"$12"},{"rsc":"$L13","isPartial":"$@14","staleTime":"$d","varyParams":null}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@15","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@16"}
